SUMMARY:\nThe Fast and the Furious – 25th Anniversary Screening 🚗💨
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\n“I live my life a quarter mile at 
 a time.”\n\nSome movies are meant to be watched with other people.\n\nTw
 enty-five years after it first hit theaters\, The Fast and the Furious is 
 back on the big screen. Whether it’s your first time or your fifteenth\,
  this is one of those movies that’s simply more fun with a crowd—laugh
 ing at the cheesy lines\, quoting your favorite moments\, and enjoying the
  nostalgia together.\n\nWe’ll meet at AMC Southpoint 17 around 4:45 PM t
 o grab popcorn\, say hello\, and find seats before the 5:10 PM showtime.\n
 \nWhat to expect:\n🏁 The movie that launched one of the biggest action 
 franchises ever\n🍿 Popcorn\, candy\, and big-screen nostalgia\n🚗 Fas
 t cars\, iconic one-liners\, and early-2000s vibes\n👋 A fun group of fe
 llow movie lovers\n\nEveryone is responsible for purchasing their own tick
 et\, so be sure to reserve yours in advance. We’ll coordinate seating in
  the event comments as we get closer.\n\nWhether you’ve been a fan since
  2001 or you’ve never seen the original in a theater\, come join us for 
 a fun night at the movies.\n\nBecause some experiences are just better whe
 n they’re shared… especially when they’re all about family.
